00:41:58.765 --> 00:42:00.730
So in supervised learning,

00:42:00.730 --> 00:42:04.375
you are given a dataset with, ah,

00:42:04.375 --> 00:42:07.120
inputs X and labels Y,

00:42:07.120 --> 00:42:12.805
